  "review_notes": [
    "`נָטַשׁ אֵת־דִּבְרֵי הָאֲתֹנוֹת` is recast as *hath left off caring for the asses*: the verb takes the whole verb phrase, the object marker takes the *for* its English verb needs, and `דִּבְרֵי` is left unrendered."
